    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Define common algorithmic signatures of search, error correction, and setpoint pursuit across molecular, morphogenetic, and locomotor tasks, then test phylogenetic ordering and mechanistic homology against independent convergence models.";
